        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The sly and evil Don Rafael Montero has devised a scheme to take control of California. The people need a hero, and that is when Zorro appears. You take the role of Zorro, using your sword and cunning to fight your way through 30 levels of action, exploring towns and mines and facing many treacherous enemies. Every wound you receive depletes Zorro's life bar a little bit, but finding hearts or kissing Elena, Zorro's beloved and Don Rafael's daughter, will allow Zorro to regain his health. A soundtrack of Spanish guitar rhythms will make you think that you are in 1820s California. Guide Zorro as he tries to save the people of California from the rule of Don Rafael in THE MASK OF ZORRO.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El astuto y malvado don Rafael Montero ha urdido un plan para tomar el control de California. La gente necesita un héroe, y entonces aparece Zorro. Tú asumes el papel de Zorro, usando tu espada y tu astucia para abrirte paso a través de 30 niveles de acción, explorando pueblos y minas y enfrentándote a numerosos enemigos traicioneros. Cada herida que recibes reduce un poco la barra de vida de Zorro, pero encontrar corazones o besar a Elena, la amada de Zorro e hija de don Rafael, le permitirá recuperar salud. Una banda sonora de ritmos de guitarra española te hará pensar que estás en la California de la década de 1820. Guía a Zorro mientras intenta salvar al pueblo de California del dominio de don Rafael en THE MASK OF ZORRO.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2000",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
